  <p id="c-songshu-050-yuan-chang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">祖<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-chang:p001:m0001" ref="bdx_txf_e62">敞</persName>，仕苻氏，為長樂國郎中令。<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-chang:p001:m0015" ref="van_pwm_swv">慕容德</persName>入青州，以<persName id="c-songshu-050-yuan-chang:p001:m0023" ref="bdx_txf_e62">敞</persName>為車騎長史。</p>
